@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@postingUrl = https://kpgroup.recruiter.co.kr/career/jobs/133045

### 공개 공고 가져오기 (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/postings/import
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "url": "{{postingUrl}}"
}

?? status == 200

### URL 누락 (400 INVALID_REQUEST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/postings/import
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{}

?? status == 400
?? body error == INVALID_REQUEST

### 서버 내부 주소 (400 INVALID_POSTING_URL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/postings/import
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "url": "http://127.0.0.1/posting"
}

?? status == 400
?? body error == INVALID_POSTING_URL
